Package: com.kpcursor.rootless
Name: 便捷光标
Version: 1.0-0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 从屏幕底部上滑唤出鼠标式光标，拖动控制移动、轻点模拟点击，单手操控更方便。iOS 15+ rootless（Dopamine）适用。
Maintainer: KPCursor <kpcursor@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: KPCursor
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
